From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:37:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compositor: give app glass Luca and Maris materials over
 frosted wallpapers

The shell hands over two blurred copies of each monitor's wallpaper, one
blurred like Luca glass and one so wide only its colours are left, and
says which style app windows and transient surfaces use and whether Luca
blurs only the wallpaper. Luca glass that blurs only the wallpaper draws
the piece of the blurred copy behind it, Maris glass the piece of the
wide one under the surface colour, both with the same saturation, grain
and corners as the blur and without a redraw clip, copy or blur.

Upstream-Status: luft-only API for Kestrel's glass styles
